    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Los "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "connected-passed-pawns",
            "text": "peones pasados unidos"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " están en columnas vecinas y se protegen uno a otro al avanzar. Son tan fuertes que, en la sexta fila, valen tanto como una torre. Aquí los de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " son pasados y están unidos: en cuanto uno avance a la sexta fila, el otro lo protegerá desde atrás."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "connected-passed-pawns",
            "text": "Connected passed pawns"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " stand on neighbouring files and protect each other as they advance. They are so strong that, on the sixth rank, they are worth as much as a rook. Here the ones on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " are passed and connected: as soon as one steps to the sixth rank, the other protects it from behind."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "8/5ppp/4k3/1PP5/8/8/5PPP/6K1 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "b5",
          "c5"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Con torres, la torre va detrás del peón pasado: desde ahí lo empuja, y cuanto más avanza el peón, más casillas ve la torre. Es la regla de Tarrasch. En la partida 34 del Mundial de 1927, Alekhine contra Capablanca, la torre blanca de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " está detrás de su peón de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Las blancas ganaron."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "With rooks, the rook goes behind the passed pawn: from there it pushes it, and the further the pawn goes, the more squares the rook sees. It is the Tarrasch rule. In game 34 of the 1927 World Championship, Alekhine against Capablanca, the white rook on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " stands behind its pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". White won."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "8/5pk1/r5pp/P7/R6P/6P1/5PK1/8 b - - 0 54",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "a4",
          "a5"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Para frenar un peón pasado, ponle una pieza delante: es el "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "blockade",
            "text": "bloqueo"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". El propio peón le hace de escudo: una torre rival no puede atacarla desde detrás del peón. El mejor bloqueador es el caballo: desde ahí sigue atacando casillas. Aquí el caballo negro de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " para el peón de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "To stop a passed pawn, put a piece in front of it: that is the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "blockade",
            "text": "blockade"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The pawn itself shields it: a rival rook cannot attack it from behind the pawn. The best blockader is the knight: from there it still attacks squares. Here the black knight on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " stops the pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "6k1/5ppp/3n4/3P4/8/8/5PPP/6K1 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "d6"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "play-out",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "La "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "lucena-position",
            "text": "posición de Lucena"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", en la columna d. Tu peón está a punto de coronar y tu torre corta al rey negro. Gana: saca el rey y "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "building-a-bridge",
            "text": "construye un puente"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " con la torre para tapar los "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "jaques"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "lucena-position",
            "text": "Lucena position"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", on the d-file. Your pawn is about to promote and your rook cuts off the black king. Win it: bring the king out and "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "building-a-bridge",
            "text": "build a bridge"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " with the rook to block the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "checks"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      "fen": "3K4/3P1k2/8/8/8/8/7r/4R3 w - - 0 1",
      "goal": "win",
      "playerSide": "white",
      "hint": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Primero sube la torre a la cuarta fila. Después saca el rey; cuando la torre negra dé "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "jaques"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", tu torre se pone delante."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "First lift the rook to the fourth rank. Then bring the king out; when the black rook gives "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "checks"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", your rook steps in front."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "play-out",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "La "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "philidor-position",
            "text": "posición de Philidor"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", con los colores cambiados. Defiendes con blancas: tu rey está delante del peón y tu torre, en tu tercera fila, no deja pasar al rey negro. Haz tablas."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "philidor-position",
            "text": "Philidor position"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", with the colours reversed. You defend with White: your king is in front of the pawn and your rook, on your third rank, keeps the black king out. Draw it."
          }
        ]
      },
      "fen": "8/8/8/8/2kp4/5R2/7r/3K4 w - - 0 1",
      "goal": "draw",
      "playerSide": "white",
      "hint": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Deja la torre en la tercera fila hasta que el peón avance a ella. Entonces vete atrás con la torre y da "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
